MN10 s10 s9 0 0 NMOS1 L=1u W=4u
C10 s10 0 50f
* stage 11: inverter s10 -> s11
MP11 s11 s10 vdd vdd PMOS1 L=1u W=8u
MN11 s11 s10 0 0 NMOS1 L=1u W=4u
C11 s11 0 50f
* stage 12: inverter s11 -> s12
